\item[ [[TillstandKurspaketering]] ] Participation status codes, e.g.\
  [[pagaende]] (active), [[ej_paborjad]] (admitted, not yet started).
\item[ [[SummeradGodkandOmfattning]] ] Approved ECTS credits
  accumulated so far.
\end{description}
