\section{[[occasion_results_JSON]]}

Student results at an examination occasion are fetched by a PUT to
[[studieresultat/rapportera/aktivitetstillfalle/{uid}/sok]].  Unlike
the per-component search in [[search_reported_results_JSON]], this
endpoint requires the course-round UID(s) in the body field
[[KurstillfallenUID]].

The [[Filtrering]] list selects which result statuses to include:
\begin{description}
\item[ [[OBEHANDLADE]] ] Registered but no grade entered.
\item[ [[UTKAST]] ] Draft grade entered, not yet certified.
\item[ [[ATTESTERADE]] ] Certified (finalized) results.
\end{description}

This is the only paginated endpoint we use that takes [[Page]] and
[[Limit]] in a JSON body rather than a URL query string.  The
[[_all_pages]] helper (\cref{Pagination}) accommodates this without
any extra plumbing because it takes a [[request_fn(page, limit)]]
closure rather than a URL --- the closure builds the appropriate
[[put_data]] dict for each page.

Each item in the returned list contains:
\begin{description}
\item[ [[Student]] ] Sub-object with [[Uid]], [[Fornamn]], [[Efternamn]].
\item[ [[ResultatPaUtbildningar]] ] List of result objects.  When a
  certified result exists, [[SenastAttesteradeResultat]] holds the grade
  with sub-fields [[Betygsgradsobjekt.Kod]] (e.g.\ [[A]]--[[F]] or
  [[P]]/[[F]]) and [[Examinationsdatum]].
\item[ [[Rapporteringskontext]] ] Contains [[UtbildningsinstansUID]] ---
  the component-instance UID required if you need to report further
  results.
\end{description}
<<LadokSession data methods>>=
def occasion_results_JSON(self, occasion_uid: str,
                          course_round_uids: list[str],
                          filtrering: list[str] | None = None) -> list:
  """Return all student results for an examination occasion.

  Args:
    occasion_uid:       UID of the examination occasion
    course_round_uids:  list of course-round UIDs for the occasion
                        (taken from the occasion's KurstillfalleUIDer)
    filtrering:         list of result-status codes to include; defaults
                        to all three ['OBEHANDLADE','UTKAST','ATTESTERADE']
  """
  if filtrering is None:
    filtrering = ["OBEHANDLADE", "UTKAST", "ATTESTERADE"]
  return self._all_pages(lambda page, limit: self.put_query(
    f"/resultat/internal/studieresultat/rapportera"
    f"/aktivitetstillfalle/{occasion_uid}/sok",
    {
      "Filtrering": filtrering,
      "KurstillfallenUID": course_round_uids,
      "OrderBy": ["EFTERNAMN_ASC", "FORNAMN_ASC", "PERSONNUMMER_ASC"],
      "Limit": limit,
      "Page": page,
    }
  ))
@

